@startuml UC6_Search_Forecast_Activity_Diagram

title UC6: Search Forecast by City - Activity Diagram

start

if (User just logged in?) then (yes)
  :System retrieves user's profile preferences;
  :System retrieves forecast data for all saved cities;
  :System sorts forecasts by SiteName, CityName, Time;
  :System displays forecast dashboard;
else (no - manual search)
  :User enters city name in search field;
  :User submits search request;
  :System retrieves forecast data for the city;
  if (Forecasts available?) then (yes)
    :System displays search results;
  else (no)
    :System displays informative message;
    stop
  endif
endif

:User views forecasts;
stop

@enduml
